    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b329580787fe9feb77b18ed2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……是、不可能的呢！\n不如说你很信任我。\n从出道战开始，一直都是……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e18258a2d35b39a7870763dda13ea5cecf0ff7d385a4eb1f81a1674a8ee208e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
