    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95d67362b328be27b73f43ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此，你依然会忍不住去想……\n因为“比赛没有绝对”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff7a38dd5deef9d2e1feb159913f444f9e7b85c0ff40c6bf9a77eb5d3cebe334",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79ffd737ffc2873c0d954c5b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那句话的原文、正确来讲是这样的。\n“比赛没有绝对，但鲁道夫象征是绝对的”――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba3278d767c8c8049795a957efe0bdc74bb9fb58f2374740ab2f1d4ca397da18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804a125d629ce566d0ca1630",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（也有输的时候啊……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "62828f9cb25a7da42251a4dbc78e5a08b97c0449629815b5138f90240bfede5c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3fb9078b564ef6a42d61f16",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很好地体现出了“皇帝”无与伦比的强大。\n可是――就连那样的她……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e91a67c54b4c8656df85b99e7add303217a2f93b31615710d11dbe695d401e12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129117.json",
      "json_path": [
